      "text": "I have written about this topic in the past—in 2022, I wrote about the AI War and how we must win:\n\nhttps://t.co/TawcO6cWSl\n\nand I gave a testimony for the House Armed Services Committee last year:\n\nhttps://t.co/oAkQ9bHpui",
