        "text": "By leveraging the best commercial models for national security, and fine-tuning them specifically for defense and intelligence use cases, we are empowering the US to succeed against our strategic competitors.\n\nThere is nothing else more important for the future of freedom."
      },
      {
        "author_id": "615818451",
